  "title": "Sour Cream Cut-Outs",
  "description": "This recipe stays soft because of the sour cream and cake flour in them. I make them every Christmas.",
  "authors": [
    "Patty Roberts"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-08-06T20:00:33-04:00",
